gw2plates is a closed-source project. This repository publishes the addon's
documentation, screenshots and release builds. The source code is not public.


Why the source is closed
------------------------
gw2plates finds enemies by reading the Guild Wars 2 client's memory, which
relies on reverse engineering of the game client. Publishing the source would
also publish those details, so the code is kept private.


Permitted use
-------------
You may download and use gw2plates free of charge, including while streaming,
recording or making videos, on monetised channels as well as personal ones.
You may quote or reuse this repository's documentation and screenshots when
describing, reviewing or showcasing gw2plates, with attribution.


Distribution via Raidcore / Nexus
---------------------------------
The author grants Raidcore and the Nexus addon library (raidcore.gg) permission
to list, host and distribute unmodified gw2plates release builds.


Restrictions
------------
Without the author's written permission you may not:

  - sell gw2plates, charge for access to it, or bundle it into a paid product
    or service;
  - redistribute modified builds, or unmodified builds other than through this
    repository's releases and the Nexus addon library;
  - decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer gw2plates, except where the law
    allows it regardless of this license.


